フ、富豪の跡取りであるが自覚は薄く、思考も庶民的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"華奢な体と童顔、その上可愛らしい女のコに見える外観をコンプレックスに思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回、父親の提案もあり、親戚であるウェンチェスター家に身分を隠して奉公修行にきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"嫌いというわけではないないが、女性が苦手で女性のいうことには逆らえない性分。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94046"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/3228d12791734eee8da45642a41966565ec2210b65fb609ff2a2d41dcb0c096b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4eebe3f0b5517161a642df38b1940750f7a2378d4f54b14929441cc2a5c49bff.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天天","creatorId":"vndb:s2922","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2922","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2922","name":"天天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:168470:94046:18086:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67509","characterName":"ステラ・C・ウェンチェスター","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94041","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"168470"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26007"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67509"},"originalCharacterName":"ステラ・C・ウェンチェスター","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: early 20s"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67509"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の従姉妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"欧州の名門貴族・ウェンチェスター家の長女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にとっては幼馴染で、憧れの年上の女性でもあった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな主人公から好意を抱かれ、まんざらでもなかった彼女だが、当時読んでいた本に書いてあった「恋愛には障害が必要」という一文を本気にして、主人公に無理難題を吹っ掛けていた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その逆境を乗り越えてくれるもののと信じていたが、結果的には主人公の駄目さ加減が浮き彫りになり、あまつさえそのことが主人公のトラウマ（女性が苦手）になった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26007","sourceWorkId":"6791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"欧州名門貴族であるウェンチェスター家の長女で、ノエルの従姉弟にあたるお嬢さま。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノエルの幼馴染でもあり、憧れの年上の女性あり、昔彼女にラブレターを出したことがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノエルの事は嫌いではないのだが、ノエルがしっかりしないので、ついイライラしていつもいじめてしまう。ノエルに対して、自覚の薄いキツめの性格で、ノエルの女性に対する苦手意識を生み出した張本人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヤキモチ焼きのツンデレキャラ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94041"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/2375fdbf4aef70c8d1bdaf28db2603a65e6392582893116af72c83422ec3a0e5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf4260f9b9b41ca3e96fe18add9e2a0363984d053e9b5cc351e92c31e6001e46.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"すずきけいこ","creatorId":"vndb:s445","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s445","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s445","name":"すずき けいこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:168470:94041:6275:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67510","characterName":"ヘンリエッタ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94042","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"168470"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26008"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67510"},"originalCharacterName":"ヘンリエッタ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: mid 20s"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67510"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウェンチェスター家に仕えるメイドの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"使用人として屋敷にやってきた主人公の教育係に任命された彼女は、何も出来ない主人公を励まし、支えてくれる優しい女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は優しく、誰にでも真摯に、献身的に接する女性。ただ優しいだけでなく、間違ったことや悪いことをした際は、しっかりと正してくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26008","sourceWorkId":"6791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ステラの住む屋敷に仕えるメイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事の出来ないノエルの教育係を任命され、色々と世話を焼いてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時には優しく、そして時には厳しい少しエッチな大人の女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"落ち込むノエルを励ましたり、男性として自信を持たせようとしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公にとってはいままで会ったことのないタイプの女性で、徐々に惹かれ始める。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94042"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ff4bdd2a0f1f90b9c1e23a320cb617778b71e6531e3d65758e0d57d0915f8f3d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cf582ae557a680586231830997ded1326d44151e6f01a091df1796dc2fa6a09.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"しまだかおり","creatorId":"vndb:s2665","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2665","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2665","name":"しまだ かおり","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:168470:94042:18664:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67511","characterName":"ジーナ・C・ウェンチェスター","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94043","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"168470"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26009"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67511"},"originalCharacterName":"ジーナ・C・ウェンチェスター","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: late 30s"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67511"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ステラの母親。主人公の叔母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりした雰囲気のノンキな奥様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自覚はないものの、他人を甘やかすことに関しては天才的な才能を持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛いモノに目がなく、主人公も彼女のお気に入りになって、甘やかされる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26009","sourceWorkId":"6791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノエルの叔母であり、ステラの実母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ポヤポヤでおっとり、その上ノンキな性格をした『奥さま』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自覚はないものの他人を甘やかすことに関しては天才的な才能をもつ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カワイイものに目がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その逆に興味のないものの名前や事柄を覚えるのが苦手。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94043"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/dea2a52b194ddb6f4dbc6b4ff5ba97e4843979b55835db6a530b7d463dae0509.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24ec70d0a1655e748310301f556d6eb31fee60bbb70c70ccc5a4370fd7d52396.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天天","creatorId":"vndb:s2922","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2922","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2922","name":"天天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:168470:94043:18086:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c67512","characterName":"パティ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"94044","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"168470"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26010"],"vndbCharacterId":"c67512"},"originalCharacterName":"パティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: early 20s"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67512"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ウェンチェスター家に仕えるメイドの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で無感情な女性で、たまに口を開くと毒の言葉を吐くので要注意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"感覚が常人とややズレがあり、主人公がステラに苛められているところを見ると「カワイイ」と思ってしまっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26010","sourceWorkId":"6791","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノエルが屋敷に来る少し前から働いている先輩メイド。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で誰に対しても『～様』付けで話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"メイドとしてのスキルはそこそこ高く、たまに主人公のフォローもしてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし通常無表情で、悪意のない毒舌でノエルをイジめてくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本的に、ステラにイジメられているノエルを見て『かわいい』と思うダメなヒト。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"94044"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/22/228e64beecdae50a1deb3b61c014020634dc676906f2f136dd60475d4ff72550.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/4221e3c2542dc38aed4a21d7409fdc012bd6534b333ab724c6a437c748d5db1c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杏露花梨","creatorId":"vndb:s2925","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2925","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2925","name":"杏露 花梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:168470:94044:21538:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67513","characterName":"ギルバート","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67513"},"originalCharacterName":"ギルバート","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: early 60s"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67513"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/35d63f3f9c92c4e5f335871ae16dde2b2acbcedf3ce518b20f70f191cd46924c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf835a01966b9e089349884e983b8e0cf76e0e564125beaba8afb3db86726101.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p491","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:195","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p491","name":"TinkerBell","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:wor